menu "HubBLE USB"
    config HUBBLE_USB_VID
        hex "USB vendor ID"
        default 0x303A
        help
            Defaults to Espressif's VID. Never use another vendor's VID (see docs/usb-ids.md).

    config HUBBLE_USB_PID
        hex "USB product ID"
        default 0x4001
        help
            Development PID. Request a dedicated one from Espressif before any public distribution
            (docs/usb-ids.md).

    config HUBBLE_USB_DEBUG_INJECT
        bool "Enable the debug 'inject test input' API (POST /api/v1/debug/input)"
        default n
        help
            Lets the web API press keys / move the mouse on the host without any BLE device, to verify the
            USB side in isolation (M2 hardware test). NEVER enable in release builds.
endmenu
